    {
      "id": "hdr",
      "label": "HDR output",
      "help": "Gives an HDR screen an HDR picture, so the desktop's HDR does not dim or wash out the game. The game's picture stays the same, without extra range in the highlights. HDR has to be on for the screen in your system's settings.",
